## 5. Botones de estatus — actualizan TODO el ID en las 3 bases

Sin condición de estatus previo: recorren todas las filas del `Request_ID`, así que un SET que quedó en *Solicitado* o *En proceso* se arrastra igual.

### ButtonCanvas14_32 (In Progress) — OnSelect

```
=Set(varReqPack; ThisItem.Request_ID);;
Set(varEstPack; "En Proceso");;
Set(varFPack; Today());;

ClearCollect(colPackExp; Filter('EXPORT-IMPORT'; Request_ID = varReqPack));;
ClearCollect(colPackSol; Filter(SOLICITUDESPA1; Request_ID = varReqPack));;
ClearCollect(colPackGlo; Filter('Global Shipping Requests'; Request_ID = varReqPack));;

ForAll(
    colPackExp As _e;
    Patch('EXPORT-IMPORT'; _e; {SHIPMENT_PROGRESS: {Value: "En Proceso"}})
);;

ForAll(
    colPackSol As _s;
    Patch(
        SOLICITUDESPA1;
        _s;
        {
            Estatus: "En proceso";
            FechaInicio: Coalesce(_s.FechaInicio; Now());
            Modificado: Now()
        }
    )
);;

ForAll(
    colPackGlo As _g;
    Patch('Global Shipping Requests'; _g; {Status: {Value: "Shipment in Progress"}})
);;

Refresh('EXPORT-IMPORT');;
Refresh(SOLICITUDESPA1);;

If(
    varFiltroID = varReqPack;
    ClearCollect(colDetalleID; SortByColumns(Filter('EXPORT-IMPORT'; Request_ID = varFiltroID); "ID"; SortOrder.Ascending))
);;

Select(btnBuildDash);;
Select(btnCorreoPackingList);;

Notify("⚙️ En Proceso · ID " & varReqPack & " · " & CountRows(colPackExp) & " set(s)"; NotificationType.Success)
```

